WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:44.369
It's f***ing exhausting to bring justice.

2
00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:46.559
Pfft. You're just a violence contractor.

3
00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:48.890
Did you just call us a violence contractor?

4
00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:53.870
We're "No Reason," here to support the weak and suffering.

5
00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:11.120
If you bully the weak again,

6
00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:16.260
you'll really die by my hands.

7
00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:18.830
That name is terrible too.

8
00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:21.480
Hey.

9
00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.390
-Really? -Yeah.

10
00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:28.499
It's totally cool. "No Reason."

11
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:29.580
No, it's not.

12
00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:33.669
Hey, but...

13
00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:34.879
(-You know that the payment is your weakness instead of money, right?
-(Client) Is this okay?)
Do you know what the kid who requested this sent?

14
00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:37.139
(-You know that the payment is your weakness instead of money, right?
-(Client) Is this okay?)
Just so I would beat up the guy who bullied him.

15
00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:38.060
What did he send?

16
00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:41.629
The kid who requested this, his dad is a university professor.

17
00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:43.750
This kid said his dad is having an affair with a student from his class.

18
00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:46.139
Ugh, what trash.

19
00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:48.070
No matter how angry you are,

20
00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:51.590
how can you sell out your parents just to beat up your bully?

21
00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:56.069
How does he know what I'll do?

22
00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:57.449
What are you going to do?

23
00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.360
I'm going to spread it.

24
00:01:58.360 --> 00:01:59.360
To whom?

25
00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:02.660
To the one who bullied him.

26
00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:13.050
You son of a bitch. I caught you red-handed. Damn it.

27
00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:18.850
You really have too much time on your hands.

28
00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:29.120
No matter how I think about it, the name is perfect.

29
00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:31.040
"No Reason."

30
00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:35.190
No reason.

31
00:02:37.510 --> 00:03:07.970
(3rd Period English, Singular Form)
(3rd Period Korean, 3rd Period English, Singular Form, Mathematics)
(Anyone who wants to study, gather here!)
(Hwang Min-hyun)
(Han Ji-eun)
(Cha Woo-min)
(Lee Jong-hyun)
(Shin Soo-hyun)
(Yoon Sang-jeong, Gong Do-yoo)

41
00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:21.450
Study Group for Thugs

42
00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:31.240
Thank you.

43
00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:36.160
What's wrong?

44
00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:38.460
Nothing.

45
00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:51.060
Mom.

46
00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:55.119
Um, the reason I came back late is...

47
00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:56.000
Hello.

48
00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:03.920
Okay.

49
00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:07.700
You came back late, and your phone was off too.

50
00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:09.989
That's because the battery...

51
00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:11.500
You know we had an appointment, right?

52
00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:13.470
Mom.

53
00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:17.230
Prepare for a transfer tomorrow, immediately.

54
00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:01.460
Hey, your house is really nice.

55
00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:08.520
Se-hyeon.

56
00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:09.640
Hmm?

57
00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:12.240
Even without me,

58
00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:15.059
please take good care of the study group.

59
00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:16.370
What are you talking about?

60
00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:20.740
You're not doing this because of what I said about transferring, are you?

61
00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:24.110
Oh, come on. I wouldn't actually make you transfer.

62
00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:25.260
No.

63
00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.450
If my mom says something like that, she really does it.

64
00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.569
Hey, even so, transferring isn't that easy.

65
00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:33.300
It won't be decided so casually.

66
00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.540
Mom told me to prepare.

67
00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.660
That means she's really going to do it.

68
00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:43.730
In middle school,

69
00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:46.929
it wasn't even vacation, but she suddenly said "Gobi Desert"

70
00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:49.390
and told me to prepare for a trip to Mongolia. It was the same then.

71
00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.540
When she told me to cut ties

72
00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:55.240
with the uncle who taught me Jeet Kune Do, it was the same then.

73
00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:56.670
And...

74
00:05:58.060 --> 00:05:58.960
Ga-min.

75
00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.640
Mom and Dad

76
00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.430
are getting divorced.

77
00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.330
Be mentally prepared.

78
00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:10.519
-What? -It's okay if you're not good at studying.

79
00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:11.490
Mom, I...

80
00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:13.940
I hope our Ga-min

81
00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:16.320
doesn't get involved in bad things.

82
00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:19.520
I just want you to grow up and be a good person.

83
00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:31.390
It's all my fault... it turned out this way.

84
00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:34.899
It's not like that.

85
00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:35.770
I...

86
00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:37.929
Stop chatting and go to sleep.

87
00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:39.190
Yes, sorry.

88
00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:41.679
This is a list of schools for transfer.

89
00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:43.309
Look at it in the morning.

90
00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:44.630
Choose where you want to go.

91
00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:01.049
Ugh, it's so crowded. I told you to sleep on the bed.

92
00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:03.699
That's why I told you to sleep on the bed!

93
00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:06.569
I said I feel uncomfortable sleeping on the bed.

94
00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:08.180
I've never slept on a bed.

95
00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:11.470
Hey.

96
00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:14.750
But why didn't you say that the homeroom teacher was also the tutor?

97
00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.049
Is that important?

98
00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:19.600
No, it's just amazing.

99
00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:22.140
So no one knows?

100
00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:24.770
Probably.

101
00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:26.870
Because my mom doesn't know either.

102
00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:33.270
But I still don't understand you.

103
00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:37.260
Your mom also thinks grades aren't important.

104
00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:39.359
And you're not like me,

105
00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:41.550
who has to worry about money to live.

106
00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:44.370
Why are you so obsessed with studying?

107
00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:52.850
Let's sleep.

108
00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:54.380
Hmm.

109
00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:56.140
What is it?

110
00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:00.230
Hey, what's up?

111
00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:01.660
Ga-min.

112
00:08:01.661 --> 00:08:04.279
Do you know how amazing what Dad achieved this time is?

113
00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:07.369
-Are you planning to follow in Dad's footsteps? -Please say a few words.

114
00:08:07.370 --> 00:08:10.040
(Reading Yoon Ga-min)

115
00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:12.290
Don't encourage him.

116
00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:13.690
Everything went smoothly.

117
00:08:13.691 --> 00:08:15.760
Only a genius like you would be capable.

118
00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:18.370
Ga-min can't do it.

119
00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:21.720
No one expects anything from him.

120
00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.060
It seems like a very sad thing.

121
00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:33.440
I'm home...

122
00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:35.269
Aren't you going to earn money, you brat?

123
00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:37.210
I told you to come to the construction site and learn.

124
00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:39.510
Is that too much to ask?

125
00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:41.200
Yes.

126
00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:43.850
That's right.

127
00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:53.130
Although it's a shame I can't continue the study group,

128
00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:57.950
I don't regret going back to see you today.

129
00:08:59.180 --> 00:08:59.850
Hmm.

130
00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:02.300
Thank you.

131
00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:10.700
(Yuseong Advanced Industrial High School)

132
00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:15.290
Are you leaving today?

133
00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:16.919
I can't believe it, damn it.

134
00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:19.259
That's why I said we should go eat tteokbokki together yesterday.

135
00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:20.739
No, it's still hard to say what will happen.

136
00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:23.040
They're already meeting with the principal and talking about it.

137
00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:25.720
-Where is this? -The principal's office.

138
00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:30.939
Everyone who goes to Yuseong Industrial High is the worst at studying.

139
00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:31.660
What?

140
00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:33.890
So what?

141
00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:36.899
Here in Ancheon,

142
00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:39.300
will any school welcome students from Yuseong Industrial High?

143
10:09:40.750 --> 00:09:42.359
First of all, regular high schools'

144
00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:44.639
curriculum is different from vocational high schools like ours.

145
00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.039
Administrative processing is not easy.

146
00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:47.599
Among vocational high schools,

147
00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.209
commercial and maritime schools

148
00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:51.359
have different majors, so it's the same.

149
00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:53.889
So the only remaining option is another industrial high school,

150
00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:56.159
which is just Seongdo High-Tech High School.

151
00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:58.550
Then if she goes to High-Tech, won't there be no hope?

152
00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:01.000
Did you forget Yoon Ga-min's grades?

153
00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.869
As expected of Yoon Ga-min.

154
00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:08.019
He already arranged everything to deal with this situation.

155
00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:10.689
It's the first time I'm grateful that the crazy glasses kid is bad at studying.

156
00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:12.780
Seriously, I told you he's smart.

157
00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:19.369
What do we do? His mom seems really angry.

158
00:10:19.370 --> 00:10:21.130
I told you transferring wouldn't be easy.

159
00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:23.400
If there are no schools she can go to in Ancheon,

160
00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:25.240
then we'll move to Seoul.

161
00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:27.529
-Seoul? -Hey, I want to look at houses.

162
00:10:27.530 --> 00:10:29.129
Is she calling a real estate agent?

163
00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:30.149
I didn't expect this.

164
00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:31.479
-Hey, you guys have to do something.

165
00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.239
-What do we do? -Should we try to persuade her?

166
00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:35.209
Then we have to prove that we're not bad students first.

167
00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:36.650
I don't like proof problems.

168
00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:38.750
How about this?

169
00:10:38.751 --> 00:10:41.459
If I'm messing around on the 3rd floor and accidentally fall,

170
00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:42.939
you guys jump down to save me.

171
00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:44.369
-Crazy, damn it! -You act that out yourself.

172
00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:45.899
Lee Ji-woo, you can't swear like that in front of an auntie.

173
00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:47.499
Hey, you jerk, what do you take me for?

174
00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:49.839
-I told you not to be so hot-headed. -When was I ever like that?

175
00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:50.740
Friends!

176
00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:57.370
Damn it, block him!

177
00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:17.019
They don't replace the broken window panes from fights.

178
00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:19.649
Cigarette butts are casually thrown on the floor.

179
00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:22.389
And no teacher says a word about it. This place

180
00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:24.030
is no longer a school.

181
00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:36.160
Where did Teacher Han-kyung go? She's not answering her phone either.

182
00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:46.580
Hello.

183
00:11:51.260 --> 00:11:52.459
Is there something you want to say?

184
00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:53.850
Yes, Auntie, um...

185
00:11:58.210 --> 00:11:59.439
This Se-hyeon

186
00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:01.610
is really good at studying.

187
00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:03.419
He's second in the whole school.

188
00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:05.039
He's really smart.

189
00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:08.249
He can even explain difficult problems in simple terms.

190
00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:09.740
What does that have to do with this?

191
00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:12.090
What?

192
00:12:12.091 --> 00:12:14.860
School rankings don't mean much to me.

193
00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:17.679
Yes.

194
00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:19.220
We need Ga-min.

195
00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:28.899
Hello. I'm Ga-min's rival, Lee Jun.

196
00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:30.679
I learned a lot from Ga-min.

197
00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.140
The strongest man at Yuseong Industrial High...

198
00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:38.439
Friends, Teacher Han-kyung said she's almost here.

199
00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:39.869
We just need to buy a little more time.

200
00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:41.150
Ji-woo, your turn.

201
00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:47.780
Actually,

202
00:13:47.781 --> 00:13:50.290
I'm pregnant with Ga-min's child...

203
00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:01.880
Mom, let's just go.

204
00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:05.700
"Child"?

205
00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.370
Really?

206
00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:18.130
Didn't you say to buy time?

207
00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.580
Friends, I think the teacher is here.

208
00:14:26.810 --> 00:14:28.209
Thank you...

209
00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:29.140
-Teacher! -Students!

210
00:14:29.141 --> 00:14:30.740
Teacher, they're already gone.

211
00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:34.159
-That fast? -Auntie called a real estate agent.

212
00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:36.019
If she signs the house contract...

213
00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:37.769
Is there anything we can do?

214
00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:39.409
After all, Teacher, you know Auntie best.

215
00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:40.680
I know her very well.

216
00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:42.890
Teacher, you know Ga-min's mom very well?

217
00:14:42.891 --> 00:14:44.369
That's why there's even less we can do.

218
00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:46.620
She thinks she was Ga-min's tutor.

219
00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:48.790
She's not just anyone.

220
00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:57.200
But...

221
00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:00.410
we can't give up because of that.

222
00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:11.880
What's this?

223
00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.869
Teacher Lee said she had something to give you just now.

224
00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:17.419
Teacher Lee Han-kyung?

225
00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:18.960
Yes, Teacher Han-kyung.

226
00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:25.260
What the hell?

227
00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:28.360
Where's Teacher Lee?

228
00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.769
I'm going to sign the contract right now.

229
00:15:30.770 --> 00:15:32.139
Aren't you going to look at the house?

230
00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:33.580
No, it's fine even if I don't see it.

231
00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:36.210
See you later.

232
00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:44.600
(Yuseong Industrial High School has a new message.)

233
00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:48.090
Crazy glasses kid, we're behind you.

234
00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:53.440
What's wrong?

235
00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:54.760
What?

236
00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:57.210
Nothing.

237
00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:03.200
Teacher...

238
00:15:03.201 --> 00:15:04.890
Teacher!

239
00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:15.410
Teacher, I think I'm going to throw up.

240
00:15:18.570 --> 00:15:19.530
Amazing!

241
00:15:19.531 --> 00:15:22.219
The navigation estimated arrival time has been reduced by a full 15 minutes!

242
00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:24.119
Wow, Teacher's driving skills are so good.

243
00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:26.309
Teacher, you're so cool!

244
00:15:26.310 --> 00:15:28.289
-A woman with a car! -It's borrowed.

245
00:15:28.290 --> 00:15:29.479
No wonder.

246
00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:30.990
So it was borrowed.

247
00:15:33.730 --> 00:15:35.060
Is that the car?

248
00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:39.299
Crazy glasses kid!

249
00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:40.610
Yoon Ga-min!

250
00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.910
Yoon Ga-min!

251
00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:05.329
Students, are you okay?

252
00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:06.579
Yes, Teacher, are you okay?

253
00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:07.500
Yes.

254
00:16:07.501 --> 00:16:08.900
-Hui-won, are you okay? -Yes.

255
00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:10.609
-Seriously... -Ah Jun.

256
00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:12.619
-Ah Jun, what's wrong with you? -What's wrong?

257
00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:13.669
Ah Jun!

258
00:16:13.670 --> 00:16:15.199
-Open the door for him! -Hey, the door's locked!

259
00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:16.970
Teacher, his ears are super red!

260
00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:21.840
Why is he doing that again?

261
00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:28.770
And who are those guys?

262
00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:38.250
Damn it.

263
00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:42.159
What are you doing?

264
00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:43.390
Just move aside already!

265
00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:47.500
F*** off! Can you just be quiet?

266
00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:52.280
Kang Tae-woo.

267
00:16:52.281 --> 00:16:53.579
-It's Kang Tae-woo. -Teacher!

268
00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:56.579
Excuse me, but you can't go any further.

269
00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:58.390
What's with that attitude towards the teacher, damn it!

270
00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:03.580
These guys are really funny.

271
00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:06.049
What? Do you want Yoon Ga-min, who's currently ranked first,

272
00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:07.800
to transfer quickly?

273
00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.009
Do you really not have the guts to have a proper fight?

274
00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:11.520
Shut up, you bastard!

275
00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:15.239
Hey, Yoon Ga-min is a guy from an inhuman realm!

276
00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:16.779
You son of a bitch!

277
00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:18.140
Still making excuses, really.

278
00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:19.890
But I'm telling you,

279
00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:22.090
even if Yoon Ga-min transfers,

280
00:17:22.550 --> 00:17:23.780
you won't become ranked first.

281
00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:26.700
What nonsense are you talking about?

282
00:17:27.260 --> 00:17:28.660
Because I'm Yoon Ga-min number two.

283
00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:30.969
This son of a bitch.

284
00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:32.930
What is he talking about, you bastard!

285
00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:35.109
Ah Jun!

286
00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.089
Brothers, grab the car keys!

287
00:17:37.090 --> 00:17:38.369
That crazy guy!

288
00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:40.059
Teacher, wait a minute!

289
00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:41.209
I'll be right back.

290
00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:42.020
Ji-woo!

291
00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:48.680
Why are you like this?

292
00:17:48.681 --> 00:17:50.040
Open the door!

293
00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:55.060
-Oh my god, what do we do? -What do we do?

294
00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:58.080
You bastard!

295
00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.380
You scumbag!

296
00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:18.050
Hey, Lee Ji-woo!

297
00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:37.200
Wow, it really doesn't hurt at all.

298
00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:41.430
Hey, you can't leave here even if you do this.

299
00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:45.199
Hey, the leader is important, you guys go first.

300
00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:47.249
What? Then what about you?

301
00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:48.819
I'm fine.

302
00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:50.559
Don't worry about me, you guys go.

303
00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.979
Hey, you crazy guy, stop acting cool!

304
00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:55.040
You're afraid to ride in that car, aren't you?

305
00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:58.450
Is it that obvious?

306
00:18:58.451 --> 00:18:59.920
Idiot!

307
00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:04.890
If you dare get beaten up again, you're dead.

308
00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:06.150
Okay.

309
00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:09.750
Hey.

310
00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:12.079
Hey... where are you going?

311
00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:13.340
Teacher, we'll leave first.

312
00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:15.670
-What about Little Jun? -He said he's not going.

313
00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:17.520
What do we do if he doesn't go?

314
00:19:18.110 --> 00:19:20.179
-Are we really just leaving? -Really?

315
00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:21.389
Then what about him?

316
00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:22.680
Teacher, let's go!

317
00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:24.730
Kids, hold on tight!

318
00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:35.859
Damn it, my motorcycle!

319
00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:38.710
F***, do you know how much that costs?!

320
00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:45.320
Just ride a bicycle from now on.

321
00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:50.240
Hey.

322
00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:54.069
It seems you have some plan in mind by staying behind alone.

323
00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:55.179
But do you think that'll work?

324
00:19:55.180 --> 00:19:56.340
I might lose, though.

325
00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.020
But this time, it doesn't matter.

326
00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:05.660
I'm not going to let you off easy.

327
00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:11.110
How dare a nerd go head-to-head with someone ranked third?

328
00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:14.010
Let's go.

329
00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:16.009
Idiot!

330
00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:17.130
F***!

331
00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:23.820
Why would you go to such lengths?

332
00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:28.540
What?

333
00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:30.700
It was the same last time with the standing army.

334
00:20:31.470 --> 00:20:33.879
Why are you so obsessed with fighting rankings?

335
00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:34.840
Actually...

336
00:20:36.140 --> 00:20:37.980
I'm not obsessed with rankings.

337
00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.950
It's just that I have a friend I want to see again.

338
00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:45.750
I need to get stronger to see him.

339
00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:53.960
Come to the amusement park tomorrow.

340
00:20:54.970 --> 00:20:55.700
What?

341
00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:00.950
(Uncle's Forbidden Technique)
"Uncle's Forbidden Technique"?

342
00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:03.909
Hey, just seeing the name makes my heart pound!

343
00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:05.930
-Hurry up and choose! -I want to learn all 10 moves!

344
00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:08.280
No, you can only choose one for self-defense.

345
00:21:12.030 --> 00:21:12.990
Then I'll choose this one.

346
00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:17.040
Why?

347
00:21:17.041 --> 00:21:19.120
All the passionate words are in it!

348
00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:23.550
Come back.

349
00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:26.600
My friend, Yoon Ga-min.

350
00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:30.500
The Big Boss Fly...

351
00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:33.880
(6th Move: The Big Boss Flying Kick)
Then I'll choose this move.

352
00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:36.309
(Uncle's Forbidden Technique, 6th Move)

353
00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:38.250
(The Big Boss Flying Kick)

354
00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:44.720
Kick!

355
00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.360
Seriously.

356
00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:56.090
What are you doing, you idiot?

357
00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:00.809
(Lease Agreement)
Yes.

358
00:22:00.810 --> 00:22:02.540
The other party said they'll be here soon.

359
00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:06.230
-Welcome. -Auntie.

360
00:22:07.180 --> 00:22:09.989
I'm not pregnant.

361
00:22:09.990 --> 00:22:11.340
It's a misunderstanding.

362
00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:15.759
Auntie, please don't let Ga-min transfer schools.

363
00:22:15.760 --> 00:22:19.230
-Did you guys follow me here? -Yes.

364
00:22:24.870 --> 00:22:27.350
I don't know how you see them,

365
00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:30.180
but to me, they are grateful friends.

366
00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:39.969
Auntie, long time no see.

367
00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:41.709
I'm only greeting you now.

368
00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:44.860
I'm Lee Han-kyung, the homeroom teacher for first-year class four.

369
00:22:46.660 --> 00:22:47.980
Han-kyung?

370
00:22:48.700 --> 00:22:51.659
So you became Ga-min's homeroom teacher.

371
00:22:51.660 --> 00:22:54.080
-Congratulations. -Thank you, Auntie.

372
00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:58.509
The atmosphere is pretty good.

373
00:22:58.510 --> 00:23:00.739
Maybe things will go more smoothly than we thought.

374
00:23:00.740 --> 00:23:02.299
I hope so.

375
00:23:02.300 --> 00:23:06.070
-But we just met, and now we have to say goodbye. -What?

376
00:23:06.660 --> 00:23:10.349
Even if you became Ga-min's homeroom teacher,

377
00:23:10.350 --> 00:23:13.990
parents all want their children to stay away from violent environments, right?

378
00:23:14.540 --> 00:23:16.669
You can call me a helicopter parent, I don't care.

379
00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:18.449
If hearing such accusations

380
00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:20.779
can keep Ga-min out of danger,

381
00:23:20.780 --> 00:23:22.150
then I'd rather be that way.

382
00:23:22.630 --> 00:23:23.540
So,

383
00:23:28.200 --> 00:23:29.380
please leave.

384
00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:31.720
It was nice to see you again.

385
00:23:33.690 --> 00:23:35.040
Why should I stay away?

386
00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:40.150
Didn't you tell me to personally confront injustice and try to change it?

387
00:23:57.160 --> 00:23:58.070
Today,

388
00:23:59.930 --> 00:24:02.230
wasn't there a teacher appointment interview?

389
00:24:05.570 --> 00:24:06.780
Are you going to give up?

390
00:24:16.600 --> 00:24:19.270
I wanted to be someone like Teacher Woo Jeong-hwa.

391
00:24:22.600 --> 00:24:24.660
But now it's all meaningless, isn't it?

392
00:24:30.790 --> 00:24:32.800
Even if you can't see Jeong-hwa,

393
00:24:33.890 --> 00:24:36.260
you can see the things Jeong-hwa saw, right?

394
00:24:37.580 --> 00:24:41.670
How about you become that kind of teacher in Jeong-hwa's place?

395
00:24:43.310 --> 00:24:45.000
The reason I came to this school

396
00:24:45.550 --> 00:24:47.680
is because of what you said back then.

397
00:24:48.400 --> 00:24:49.260
That's right.

398
00:24:49.261 --> 00:24:51.359
Yuseong Industrial High is not a good school.

399
00:24:51.360 --> 00:24:56.599
I'm also well aware that I shouldn't stop Ga-min from studying in a better environment.

400
00:24:56.600 --> 00:24:57.520
But...

401
00:24:58.610 --> 00:25:00.700
the children are so eager.

402
00:25:01.900 --> 00:25:04.280
Can't you believe in the children just once?

403
00:25:09.440 --> 00:25:12.890
Ga-min and his friends even formed a study group themselves.

404
00:25:13.370 --> 00:25:14.699
With students like these,

405
00:25:14.700 --> 00:25:16.990
it will definitely become an excellent school soon.

406
00:25:17.760 --> 00:25:19.480
I will also work hard to make that happen.

407
00:25:28.630 --> 00:25:29.920
I want to go to Yuseong Industrial High.

408
00:25:30.680 --> 00:25:33.980
I want to improve my grades at that school and go to college.

409
00:25:36.460 --> 00:25:37.939
I told you you don't have to go to college.

410
00:25:37.940 --> 00:25:39.950
Isn't Ga-min joining the study group?

411
00:25:42.020 --> 00:25:44.169
Our Ga-min is very shy.

412
00:25:44.170 --> 00:25:48.129
Ga-min and his friends even formed a study group themselves.

413
00:25:48.130 --> 00:25:49.750
We need Ga-min.

414
00:25:50.850 --> 00:25:52.640
Please don't let Ga-min transfer.

415
00:26:05.910 --> 00:26:06.630
Then...

416
00:26:12.900 --> 00:26:14.180
Hey, have you seen this?

417
00:26:14.710 --> 00:26:16.900
Oh my god, the vice principal was terrified.

418
00:26:21.130 --> 00:26:23.229
(Yuseong Advanced Industrial High School: Inspection Team from the Office of Education)
That teacher is really too arrogant, isn't she?

419
00:26:23.230 --> 00:26:25.279
Should we leave it to No Reason to handle?

420
00:26:25.280 --> 00:26:26.370
You especially...

421
00:26:31.690 --> 00:26:32.450
No way.

422
00:26:33.490 --> 00:26:34.450
Are you going to hit her again?

423
00:26:35.380 --> 00:26:36.680
Like that teacher last year?

424
00:26:40.510 --> 00:26:42.960
Everyone out. We're closing for business.

425
00:26:58.080 --> 00:26:58.860
Lock it.

426
00:27:00.480 --> 00:27:02.190
Hi, study group buddies.

427
00:27:06.530 --> 00:27:07.910
This doesn't concern you.

428
00:27:10.280 --> 00:27:11.240
Let me see.

429
00:27:12.660 --> 00:27:14.109
Ms. Lee Han-kyung.

430
00:27:14.110 --> 00:27:15.170
Let's talk.

431
00:27:15.890 --> 00:27:17.439
Ms. Lee Han-kyung?

432
00:27:17.440 --> 00:27:19.619
-How dare you be so disrespectful to the teacher, you brat! -Hey!

433
00:27:19.620 --> 00:27:21.550
Auntie is here too.

434
00:27:24.960 --> 00:27:27.080
I don't know who you are,

435
00:27:28.320 --> 00:27:30.359
but I'm having a discussion with a student's parent.

436
00:27:30.360 --> 00:27:31.670
Please wait outside.

437
00:27:34.360 --> 00:27:36.390
Let's continue what we were talking about, Mrs. Yoon.

438
00:27:36.950 --> 00:27:38.240
Okay.

439
00:27:46.290 --> 00:27:47.750
F*** you.

440
00:27:50.460 --> 00:27:53.060
I was so scared I almost actually went out to wait.

441
00:28:04.830 --> 00:28:06.090
Are you here because of Pyo Han-wool?

442
00:28:06.920 --> 00:28:08.959
Because the Ministry of Education received a petition?

443
00:28:08.960 --> 00:28:10.460
Probably.

444
00:28:15.200 --> 00:28:16.449
Students.

445
00:28:16.450 --> 00:28:19.579
If you have an urgent matter and want to take up someone else's time,

446
00:28:19.580 --> 00:28:21.040
you should ask for their understanding,

447
00:28:21.980 --> 00:28:23.330
not threaten them.

448
00:28:24.000 --> 00:28:24.830
Understood?

449
00:28:32.970 --> 00:28:35.060
So you're not going to come with us quietly?

450
00:28:36.530 --> 00:28:38.509
Everything that happens here from now on

451
00:28:38.510 --> 00:28:40.800
will be handled by Yeon-baek.

452
00:28:42.570 --> 00:28:43.430
Go, kids!

453
00:29:04.880 --> 00:29:06.100
Who's that old lady? Damn it!

454
00:29:09.790 --> 00:29:12.869
I'm a very angry parent right now.

455
00:29:12.870 --> 00:29:14.670
(Jeon Mi-hyeon, Ga-min's Mother, Director of the Korea Taekwondo Association)

456
00:29:15.360 --> 00:29:17.509
Oh, Auntie is also this strong?

457
00:29:17.510 --> 00:29:18.690
No wonder.

458
00:29:22.690 --> 00:29:24.009
Teacher Lee Han-kyung.

459
00:29:24.010 --> 00:29:25.430
You've become much calmer.

460
00:29:26.110 --> 00:29:27.520
Jeong-hwa would be so happy to see you.

461
00:29:28.450 --> 00:29:31.390
But I'm still calling you Han-kyung like before.

462
00:29:31.970 --> 00:29:32.860
Sorry.

463
00:29:35.330 --> 00:29:36.300
You brats

464
00:29:36.670 --> 00:29:38.310
need to be taught a lesson by Auntie.

465
00:29:38.830 --> 00:29:40.200
Don't go home crying.

466
00:29:40.780 --> 00:29:42.389
If mothers start fighting,

467
00:29:42.390 --> 00:29:43.890
it's a lot of trouble.

468
00:29:45.620 --> 00:29:46.400
What the hell?

469
00:29:48.160 --> 00:29:49.410
Hui-won, let's step back.

470
00:29:55.450 --> 00:29:56.750
Hey, damn it!

471
00:30:05.110 --> 00:30:05.840
Mom.

472
00:30:06.370 --> 00:30:08.630
This is Lee Ji-woo from our study group.

473
00:30:10.050 --> 00:30:12.120
She's definitely not a student who likes to fight.

474
00:30:12.630 --> 00:30:14.830
She wants to be a teacher, just like Teacher Han-kyung.

475
00:30:16.600 --> 00:30:18.159
It seems she knows judo.

476
00:30:18.160 --> 00:30:20.339
Yes, that's just her hobby.

477
00:30:20.340 --> 00:30:21.769
Don't move...

478
00:30:21.770 --> 00:30:23.490
Stop moving!

479
00:30:24.450 --> 00:30:26.190
This is Kim Se-hyeon, whom you know.

480
00:30:26.960 --> 00:30:29.889
Although he seems annoying, he's actually very kind.

481
00:30:29.890 --> 00:30:31.270
And he studies very well too.

482
00:30:31.970 --> 00:30:34.840
Next to him is Choi Hui-won, who is introverted but sometimes unpredictable.

483
00:30:35.480 --> 00:30:37.069
She's passionate and loyal.

484
00:30:37.070 --> 00:30:39.120
She is a bit unpredictable.

485
00:30:39.910 --> 00:30:42.539
And there's a very honest student named Lee Jun,

486
00:30:42.540 --> 00:30:44.059
who is different from his appearance.

487
00:30:44.060 --> 00:30:46.369
You actually found so many people at that school?

488
00:30:46.370 --> 00:30:47.290
Yes.

489
00:30:47.940 --> 00:30:49.710
They are all friends I am very grateful for.

490
00:31:02.570 --> 00:31:03.440
What a shame.

491
00:31:30.110 --> 00:31:31.429
(Officer Na Tae-man)
Hey.

492
00:31:31.430 --> 00:31:32.940
(Officer Na Tae-man)
Hey, Teacher!

493
00:32:06.760 --> 00:32:07.730
Mrs. Yoon.

494
00:32:13.010 --> 00:32:14.130
Mrs. Yoon!

495
00:33:15.960 --> 00:33:16.750
Ga-min!

496
00:33:36.420 --> 00:33:38.110
Hey, Yoon Ga-min! Come here!

497
00:34:00.710 --> 00:34:01.620
Damn it.

498
00:34:06.200 --> 00:34:07.650
That's a pretty fresh move.

499
00:34:18.880 --> 00:34:21.690
I know you're angry about your mom getting hurt yesterday,

500
00:34:22.860 --> 00:34:23.980
but that's enough.

501
00:34:24.850 --> 00:34:26.370
This is a sacred school.

502
00:34:31.050 --> 00:34:33.409
School broadcast room announcement.

503
00:34:33.410 --> 00:34:36.439
All students, please gather in the gymnasium now.

504
00:34:36.440 --> 00:34:38.900
Don't hit him too hard, let him still be able to visit his mom.

505
00:34:44.220 --> 00:34:46.890
Is this the kid who's been acting so tough at school lately?

506
00:34:47.990 --> 00:34:49.190
You guys go downstairs.

507
00:34:49.910 --> 00:35:01.040
What's the point of going together?
We're not some thugs.
Fine, have it your way.
Don't go too hard on him.
Where are you going?
Come here.

512
00:35:12.300 --> 00:35:13.690
I'm going to take care of all of you at once.

513
00:35:15.630 --> 00:35:16.760
Isn't it obvious?

514
00:35:17.480 --> 00:35:18.870
It must have been Pyo Han-wool's orders.

515
00:35:20.120 --> 00:35:21.120
Pyo Han-wool again?

516
00:35:21.121 --> 00:35:24.260
It must be because Teacher Han-kyung submitted a petition to the Ministry of Education.

517
00:35:26.980 --> 00:35:28.129
Even if I don't know what that petition is,

518
00:35:28.130 --> 00:35:29.639
the teacher did it for the good of the school, right?

519
00:35:29.640 --> 00:35:30.430
So what?

520
00:35:30.950 --> 00:35:32.440
Are you going to beat up Pyo Han-wool?

521
00:35:35.600 --> 00:35:37.319
I can't just swallow this anger.

522
00:35:37.320 --> 00:35:38.900
Even you can't beat them.

523
00:35:40.060 --> 00:35:41.530
Pyo Han-wool's bodyguards,

524
00:35:42.250 --> 00:35:43.420
the Yeon-seo Three Philosophers.

525
00:35:44.660 --> 00:35:46.360
(Yeon-seo Three Philosophers: Lee Dae-cheol (3rd Year),
Kim Soon-cheol (3rd Year), Park Min-cheol (3rd Year))

526
00:35:47.280 --> 00:35:48.869
Block one punch, two punches fly.

527
00:35:48.870 --> 00:35:50.459
Block two punches, three punches fly.

528
00:35:50.460 --> 00:35:51.690
That's the Yeon-seo Three Philosophers.

529
00:35:52.420 --> 00:35:54.149
And among the Yeon-seo Three Philosophers,

530
00:35:54.150 --> 00:35:56.419
Kim Soon-cheol is the most special.

531
00:35:56.420 --> 00:35:57.829
Because he, purely with his fighting skills,

532
00:35:57.830 --> 00:35:59.880
received an olive branch from Pyo Han-wool.

533
00:36:24.030 --> 00:36:26.329
He beat up the talent scout, so I was pretty excited.

534
00:36:26.330 --> 00:36:27.649
But the result was really disappointing.

535
00:36:27.650 --> 00:36:30.419
With your skills, how dare you tell all three of us to come at you at once?

536
00:36:30.420 --> 00:36:32.359
Don't be arrogant in front of Han-wool.

537
00:36:32.360 --> 00:36:33.730
Just go to school quietly.

538
00:36:44.750 --> 00:36:46.980
Your heart is pounding, making it hard to concentrate, right?

539
00:36:47.610 --> 00:36:48.879
How did you know?

540
00:36:48.880 --> 00:36:50.999
This is what they call 'emotional fluctuation'.

541
00:36:51.000 --> 00:36:51.660
'Emotional fluctuation'?

542
00:36:51.660 --> 00:36:52.530
(Hanlim Gymnasium)

543
00:36:52.531 --> 00:36:54.959
It's when you're affected by something,

544
00:36:54.960 --> 00:36:59.230
your heart goes thump-thump, and you become a fool.

545
00:37:00.450 --> 00:37:01.400
But, you see,

546
00:37:01.401 --> 00:37:02.469
a person whose emotions fluctuate

547
00:37:02.470 --> 00:37:04.460
cannot win against anyone.

548
00:37:09.590 --> 00:37:10.450
Oh dear.

549
00:37:10.451 --> 00:37:11.619
That kid got back up again.

550
00:37:11.620 --> 00:37:12.699
Are you going to hit him again?

551
00:37:12.700 --> 00:37:16.210
F***, even if we don't all go, you can't even win a 1-on-1 fight!

552
00:37:22.020 --> 00:37:24.600
A third-rate person makes the water cup overflow.

553
00:37:25.600 --> 00:37:28.319
A second-rate person keeps the water surface calm.

554
00:37:28.320 --> 00:37:29.480
And then,

555
00:37:31.850 --> 00:37:36.070
a first-rate person empties the water cup.

556
00:37:37.090 --> 00:37:39.120
I can beat all three of you, that's why I called you.

557
00:37:49.300 --> 00:37:50.470
He's become so calm.

558
00:37:58.050 --> 00:37:58.880
He actually blocked it.

559
00:38:14.610 --> 00:38:16.909
(Uncle's Forbidden Technique, 2nd Move)

560
00:38:16.910 --> 00:38:19.510
(Unfair Competition)

561
00:38:43.220 --> 00:38:45.030
The way to win is actually very simple.

562
00:38:47.190 --> 00:38:48.820
It's just a little unsatisfying.

563
00:38:55.640 --> 00:38:56.650
You just wait.

564
00:39:04.960 --> 00:39:06.570
It's not over yet.

565
00:39:19.810 --> 00:39:20.780
(Uncle's Forbidden Technique, 6th Move)

566
00:39:20.781 --> 00:39:22.610
(The Big Boss Flying Kick)

567
00:39:55.460 --> 00:39:58.610
(Those who want to be dogs, gather!)

568
00:40:02.620 --> 00:40:03.910
Is it because of me?

569
00:40:08.360 --> 00:40:10.589
If I had left Se-hyeon alone that day,

570
00:40:10.590 --> 00:40:13.149
and followed Mom's curfew,

571
00:40:13.150 --> 00:40:14.050
Hello.

572
00:40:19.470 --> 00:40:20.340
Hey, what's that?

573
00:40:20.341 --> 00:40:22.470
If you smash this, you won't have to...

574
00:40:25.460 --> 00:40:28.340
(Studying)
If I hadn't said I was going to form a study group at this school,

575
00:40:29.730 --> 00:40:32.420
I want to go to Yuseong Industrial High.

576
00:40:32.990 --> 00:40:33.750
No.

577
00:40:34.540 --> 00:40:36.560
If I hadn't come to this school in the first place,

578
00:40:40.580 --> 00:40:42.070
none of this would have happened, right?

579
00:40:47.160 --> 00:40:51.920
Now I will protect the students who are hurt because of them.

580
00:40:53.460 --> 00:40:55.380
I don't care who they are.

581
00:40:57.260 --> 00:40:59.030
But helping friends

582
00:40:59.480 --> 00:41:01.810
and studying at school isn't wrong, is it?

583
00:41:05.440 --> 00:41:06.990
What the hell?

584
00:41:31.640 --> 00:41:35.710
Study Group for Thugs

